# This repo is PUBLIC and deliberately scrubbed: no real addresses, SSIDs or
# credentials. Anything here exists to keep it that way.

# Your camera list for tools/fleet-status.sh. Real IPs/hostnames — never commit.
# The tool ships with no host list baked in precisely so this file can be local.
tools/hosts.local

# The SSH public key(s) allowed to log into your cameras, read by
# tools/write-sd-card.sh. A public key is not a secret, but it IS an identifier —
# it carries user@host — and this repo is scrubbed of those. Same reasoning as
# hosts.local: the tool ships with no key baked in so this file can be local.
tools/authorized_keys.local
